    {"type": "list", "heading": "Every page, as of Nov 20 2026", "items": [{"t": "Home · /", "d": "937 words. Hero, who it's for, six doors to your offers, Google reviews, the free PDF, your story teaser, Dream to Rise."}, {"t": "Work With Jourdi · /work-with-jourdi", "d": "Your intro and the same six doors. Two of its buttons go to pages that no longer exist."}, {"t": "Embodied Breathwork · /breathwork", "d": "Your story, what a session looks like, who it's for, packages. Says “Now booking June, 2026.”"}, {"t": "Meet Me Upstairs · /meet-me-upstairs", "d": "The group program at $333 or $555 a month, with a waitlist. Still the old name."}, {"t": "Keynote Speaking · /speaking", "d": "Topics, a media kit button and press. The trailer says “coming soon.”"}, {"t": "Events & Retreats · /events-retreats", "d": "Sunday Service (Oct 18) and Ananda (Nov 20 to 22). Uses an older menu."}, {"t": "Ananda Retreat 2026 · /ananda-retreat-2026", "d": "Full sales page: rooms, prices, deposit, reviews, fine print."}, {"t": "Gifts for You · /gifts-for-you", "d": "The 10 Practical Things PDF."}, {"t": "Contact · /contact", "d": "A sign-up form, no other words."}, {"t": "The Story, Courses · /the-story, /courses", "d": "“Coming soon.”"}, {"t": "Disco · /disco", "d": "Blank."}, {"t": "Blog · /blog", "d": "Showit's demo posts, live and public."}, {"t": "Services, Gallery · /services, /gallery-2", "d": "Page not found, but still linked from your home and Work With Jourdi pages."}]}
